`:339` and `intents(source)` `:345`) and `crates/core/src/orders/semantics.rs` (`mod tests` at
`:2292`).** Naming is a full sentence in snake_case, no `test_` prefix. Reuse `region(units)` `:2305`,
`unit(id)` `:2327`, `check(regions, orders)` `:2430`, `only(findings)` `:2472`, `codes(&findings)`
`:2455`, `disabling(code)` `:4775`.

